{"id": "atlas-p01799", "blocks": [{"id": "atlas-p01799", "text": "50_FOLDED_COMPOSITE_AND_UNSTABLE/", "style": "HEADING_2", "sourceParagraph": 1799}, {"id": "atlas-p01800", "text": "Purpose: Places where reduction, restoration, representation, or incompatible world laws produce visible seams.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 1800}, {"id": "atlas-p01801", "text": "Corruption tendency: Moderate to extreme. These directories are deeper because ordinary language increasingly fails to distinguish room from process, map from territory, repair from replacement, and environment from executable rule.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 1801}, {"id": "atlas-p01802", "text": "├── composite_survival_worlds/", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 1802}, {"id": "atlas-p01803", "text": "│   ├── [ID:021] The Folded Garden of Six Traditions", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 1803}, {"id": "atlas-p01804", "text": "│   └── [ID:066] The Mosaic Worldscar", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 1804}, {"id": "atlas-p01805", "text": "├── .moving_seams/", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 1805}, {"id": "atlas-p01806", "text": "│   └── [ID:061] The Skyfold Boundary", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 1806}, {"id": "atlas-p01807", "text": "├── .restoration_conflicts/", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 1807}, {"id": "atlas-p01808", "text": "│   ├── [ID:062] The Valley That Restores Wrong", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 1808}, {"id": "atlas-p01809", "text": "│   ├── [ID:095] The Half-Restored Palace of Floors", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 1809}, {"id": "atlas-p01810", "text": "│   ├── [ID:096] The Rooms of Mismatched Seasons", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 1810}, {"id": "atlas-p01811", "text": "│   └── [ID:098] The Hall That Forgets Its Walls", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 1811}, {"id": "atlas-p01812", "text": "└── ?representation_becomes_place/", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT",